# 离线工具契约夹具，仅依赖框架内置组件，不依赖任何游戏工程。
layer base
region header top 9%
region info top 13% column pad-x 5%
put infoPanel size fill
region beforeBoard top 3%
region board top 32% column pad-x 8%
put parcelGrid size auto cross 100%
region beforeCards top 4%
region cards top 8% row pad-x 5% gap 2%
put card0 size fill
put card1 size fill
region safe bottom 11.5%
region footerBand bottom 7.5% row pad-x 5% gap 2%
put primaryButton size fill
put secondaryButton size fill
